From 50cac21af14f966641f2814024c3ee995271ddde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iitimii <timiiowolabi@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 03:25:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 25/32] S3.1: duo tier registry + bundle-manifest
 auto-discovery

Pure refactor: front/expert hardcoded pair -> tier registry (tier_role,
tier_policy, tier_state, duo_tier). Registry populated by bundle-manifest
auto-discovery (gguf_init_from_file no_alloc metadata read), overridable by
--tier/--tier-file/--tier-ctx/--tier-policy; --front-prefix/--expert-prefix
become aliases for --tier front=/--tier mid=. Loading order/semantics for
front+mid unchanged; a discovered easy tier is registered but not loaded
(S3.3 adds that). Policy is stored, not acted on (C4 wires it).

Regression gate: router/codraft/verify on bundle/muta-duo-q.gguf produce
byte-identical stdout before and after (sha256 verified); trio bundle
(3 tiers) auto-discovers front+easy+mid and routes correctly with mid at
its real prefix m2.; front-prefix/expert-prefix alias run matches the
plain run. build-noblas and the container build (all 4 targets) are clean.

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5
